lit-search-mcp is a router. It does not contain or modify the literature search
servers it routes to. Those servers are separate works by cyanheads (Casey Hand),
each licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and are installed from npm
as dependencies:

  @cyanheads/openalex-mcp-server          https://github.com/cyanheads/openalex-mcp-server
  @cyanheads/arxiv-mcp-server             https://github.com/cyanheads/arxiv-mcp-server
  @cyanheads/pubmed-mcp-server            https://github.com/cyanheads/pubmed-mcp-server
  @cyanheads/crossref-mcp-server          https://github.com/cyanheads/crossref-mcp-server
  @cyanheads/gutenberg-mcp-server         https://github.com/cyanheads/gutenberg-mcp-server
  @cyanheads/openlibrary-mcp-server       https://github.com/cyanheads/openlibrary-mcp-server
  @cyanheads/internet-archive-mcp-server  https://github.com/cyanheads/internet-archive-mcp-server

Copyright 2026 cyanheads. Each package carries its own LICENSE file.

